<title>NORWAY: Hydro 100 mln NOK deal with Volvo.</title>
<headline>Hydro 100 mln NOK deal with Volvo.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Hydro Aluminium Fundo, a subsidiary of Norsk Hydro ASA, has signed a contract with Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo for the development and production of aluminium wheels for a new car, Hydro said.</p>
<p>A statement said the order was worth about 100 million Norwegian crowns and strengthened Fundo's position as a development partner for Volvo in wheels. The new model will be in production in 1998.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
